   =========================== -->
    <item id="mission01_nemesis_description" style="nemesis_description"><![CDATA[Mucillator is a Nemetrix alien, predator of Crashhopper. It has sticky sacks all over his body which trap its prey.]]></item>
    <item id="mission02_nemesis_description" style="nemesis_description"><![CDATA[Buglizard is a Nemetrix alien, predator of Stinkfly. It's a very fast alien with razor sharp claws and the power to emit clouds of smoke for camouflage or escaping purposes.]]></item>
    <item id="mission03_nemesis_description" style="nemesis_description"><![CDATA[Terroranchula is a Nemetrix alien, predator of Ball Weevil. It can nullify Ball Weevil’s explosive gummy balls by shooting webs from its mouth.]]></item>
    <item id="mission04_nemesis_description" style="nemesis_description"><![CDATA[Slamworm is a Nemetrix alien, predator of Armodrillo.  It  is equipped with sharp spikes on his back and the ability to dig underground tunnels on solid rock or even metal.]]></item>
    <item id="mission05_nemesis_description" style="nemesis_description"><![CDATA[Tyrannopede is a Nemetrix alien, predator of Humungousaur. It's a very strong alien with razor sharp teeth and can shoot silky threadlike material from its horn, which wraps its prey in a cocoon.]]></item>

