    <item id="mission01_description" style="mission_description"><![CDATA[The Omnitrix stabiliser core has been stolen by Khyber! Don't forget to collect the code letters.]]></item>
    <item id="mission02_description" style="mission_description"><![CDATA[Still on the trail of Khyber's dog, Ben tracks him to Bellwood and gives chase.]]></item>
    <item id="mission03_description" style="mission_description"><![CDATA[Khyber’s dog has escaped back to his base. Time to rock n’ roll with Ball Weevil though Bellwood!]]></item>
    <item id="mission04_description" style="mission_description"><![CDATA[Ben must track Khyber's dog and try to find a way to reach Khyber's location.]]></item>
